@startuml
start
:Login;
[*] --> Unauthenticated

Unauthenticated -> RoleSelection : Login successful

RoleSelection -> QuizCreation : Teacher selected
RoleSelection -> QuizSelection : Student selected

QuizCreation -> QuizEditing : Edit quiz
QuizEditing -> DraftSaved : Save draft
DraftSaved -> QuizPosted : Post quiz

QuizPosted -> ResultsViewed : View results

QuizSelection -> AnsweringQuiz : Start answering
AnsweringQuiz -> SubmittedQuiz : Submit answers

SubmittedQuiz -> ViewResults : View result
ResultsViewed --> [*]
SubmittedQuiz --> [*]

@enduml
